### Batch Document Extraction (upload multiple documents)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/ocr/extract-batch
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WMOCRBatch

------WMOCRBatch
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\Users\rmsan\Downloads\EV_Fleet_Incident_Management (1).pdf
------WMOCRBatch
